Cell["\<\
cloudSelfTest[] runs bcmSelfTest[] (the metric: stored reference values, \
coframe, derivatives against finite differences, completion) and \
scalarSelfTest[] (f and S against the stored reference values, 2\[Pi]\
\[Integral]|S|^2 = 1, and the cloud mass from \[CapitalPhi], which must equal \
10^-4; this NIntegrate takes a few minutes).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7093fca7-cf48-4220-8ba2-7b0f40f16184"],

