Cell["\<\
Energy density -T^v_v (physical) along the equator, and the cloud mass (a few \
minutes; equals 10^-4 for the reference run):\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0395e161-1cad-4694-abb4-4ea7979cbf45"],

